<view class="page login-page"><view class="eyebrow">LOST · FOUND · HDU</view><view class="hero-title"><view>让每一份牵挂，</view><view>都有回音。</view></view><view class="muted intro">找回遗失的小物件，连接校园里的善意。</view><view class="panel"><view class="h2">登录校园账号</view><view class="label">学号 / 职工号</view><input value="{{account}}" data-field="account" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入账号"/><view class="label">密码</view><input password value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入密码"/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">登录</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="wechat">已绑定账号 · 微信登录</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="help">忘记密码？</button></view><view class="fine center">仅面向已验证的校园账号开放</view></view>
